#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.rst:2
msgid "mulsum"
msgstr ""

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:1
msgid "Compute sum or mean of element-wise product in a memory-efficient way."
msgstr "メモリ効率に優れた方法で、要素ごとの積の和または平均を計算します。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:3
msgid ""
"This function calculates the sum (or mean) of the element-wise product of"
" two tensors ``(x * y).sum(dim)`` or ``(x * y).mean(dim)`` without "
"creating the intermediate product tensor in memory. This is particularly "
"crucial when working with large tensors or when broadcasting would result"
" in a very large intermediate tensor that could exceed available memory."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、中間的な積テンソルをメモリ上に作成することなく、2つのテンソルの要素ごとの積の和（または平均） ``(x * "
"y).sum(dim)`` または ``(x * y).mean(dim)`` "
"を計算します。これは、特に大規模なテンソルを扱う場合や、ブロードキャスト操作によって中間テンソルが非常に大きくなり、利用可能なメモリを超える可能性がある場合に特に重要です。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:10
msgid "The first input tensor."
msgstr "最初の入力テンソル。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:13
msgid "The second input tensor. Must be broadcastable with :attr:`x`."
msgstr "第2の入力テンソル。 :attr:`x`\\ とブロードキャスト可能である必要があります。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:16
msgid ""
"The dimension(s) along which to compute the sum or mean. If not specified"
" (default is empty tuple), the operation is computed over all dimensions."
msgstr "和または平均を計算する次元を指定します。指定しない場合（デフォルトは空のタプル）、全ての次元にわたって計算が行われます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:21
msgid ""
"Whether the output tensor has :attr:`dim` retained or not. Default is "
"False."
msgstr "出力テンソルが :attr:`dim` を保持するかどうか。デフォルトは False。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:25
msgid ""
"If True, computes the mean instead of sum. Default is False (computes "
"sum)."
msgstr "Trueの場合、和ではなく平均を計算します。デフォルトはFalse（和を計算）です。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:29
msgid ""
"Delta degrees of freedom for mean calculations. The divisor used is ``N -"
" _ddof``, where ``N`` is the number of elements. Default is 0. This is an"
" internal parameter."
msgstr ""
"平均計算における自由度の増分。使用する除数は ``N - _ddof`` で、ここで ``N`` は要素数を表します。デフォルト値は 0 "
"です。これは内部パラメータです。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:34
msgid ""
"The sum or mean of the element-wise product. The shape depends on the "
"input dimensions, :attr:`dim`, and :attr:`keepdim` parameters."
msgstr "要素ごとの積の和または平均。形状は入力次元、:attr:`dim`、および :attr:`keepdim` パラメータに依存します。"

#: ../../api/qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.rst
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:39
msgid "Example"
msgstr "使用例"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:41
msgid ""
">>> # Simple element-wise product sum\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([2.0, 3.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.mulsum(x, y)\n"
"tensor(20.)"
msgstr ""
">>> # 単純な要素ごとの積の合計\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([2.0, 3.0, 4.0])\n"
">>> QF.mulsum(x, y)\n"
"tensor(20.)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:47
msgid ""
">>> # Equivalent to (x * y).sum()\n"
">>> torch.allclose(QF.mulsum(x, y), (x * y).sum())\n"
"True"
msgstr ""
">>> # (x * y).sum() と等価\n"
">>> torch.allclose(QF.mulsum(x, y), (x * y).sum())\n"
"True"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:51
msgid ""
">>> # Mean instead of sum\n"
">>> QF.mulsum(x, y, mean=True)\n"
"tensor(6.6667)"
msgstr ""
">>> # 合計の代わりに平均\n"
">>> QF.mulsum(x, y, mean=True)\n"
"tensor(6.6667)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:55
msgid ""
">>> # 2D tensors with specific dimension\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, 4.0]])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([[2.0, 1.0], [1.0, 2.0]])\n"
">>> QF.mulsum(x, y, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([ 4., 11.])"
msgstr ""
">>> # 次元を指定した2次元テンソル\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[1.0, 2.0], [3.0, 4.0]])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([[2.0, 1.0], [1.0, 2.0]])\n"
">>> QF.mulsum(x, y, dim=1)\n"
"tensor([ 4., 11.])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:61
msgid ""
">>> # Memory-efficient broadcasting\n"
">>> x = torch.randn(1000, 1)\n"
">>> y = torch.randn(1, 1000)\n"
">>> # Efficiently computes without creating 1000x1000 intermediate tensor"
"\n"
">>> result = QF.mulsum(x, y)"
msgstr ""
">>> # メモリ効率の良いブロードキャスト\n"
">>> x = torch.randn(1000, 1)\n"
">>> y = torch.randn(1, 1000)\n"
">>> # 1000x1000の中間テンソルを作らずに効率的に計算\n"
">>> result = QF.mulsum(x, y)"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:67
msgid ""
">>> # With keepdim\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, 2.0]], [[3.0, 4.0]]])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([[[2.0, 1.0]], [[1.0, 2.0]]])\n"
">>> QF.mulsum(x, y, dim=(1, 2), keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[[ 4.]],\n"
"\n"
"        [[11.]]])"
msgstr ""
">>> # keepdim を使用\n"
">>> x = torch.tensor([[[1.0, 2.0]], [[3.0, 4.0]]])\n"
">>> y = torch.tensor([[[2.0, 1.0]], [[1.0, 2.0]]])\n"
">>> QF.mulsum(x, y, dim=(1, 2), keepdim=True)\n"
"tensor([[[ 4.]],\n"
"\n"
"        [[11.]]])"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:75
msgid ""
":attr:`x` and :attr:`y` must have the same dtype; mixing dtypes (e.g., an"
" integer tensor with a floating-point tensor) raises a ``RuntimeError`` "
"instead of casting implicitly."
msgstr ":attr:`x` と :attr:`y` は同じdtypeでなければなりません。異なるdtype（例: 整数テンソルと浮動小数点テンソル）を混在させると、暗黙的にキャストされる代わりに ``RuntimeError`` が送出されます。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:80
msgid ":func:`mulmean`: Convenience function for computing means."
msgstr ":func:`mulmean`: 平均値計算のための便利な関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:81
msgid ":func:`einsum`: The underlying Einstein summation function."
msgstr ":func:`einsum`: 基礎となるアインシュタイン総和関数。"

#: of qfeval_functions.functions.mulsum.mulsum:82
msgid ":func:`covar`: Uses this function for efficient covariance calculations."
msgstr ":func:`covar`: 効率的な共分散計算のためにこの関数を使用します。"

